  '7-foot tank':'7英尺深的雨水箱','4-foot tank':'4英尺深的雨水箱','7-foot low area':'7英尺深的低洼区','4-foot low area':'4英尺深的低洼区',
  'wide drain':'加宽排水口','standard drain':'标准排水口','no shade':'没有遮阴','shade sails':'遮阳帆','trees and sails':'树和遮阳帆',
  // why
  '<b>{0}.</b> In a big storm, the street stays dry about {1} times in 10. It costs {2} of 400 coins and needs {3} night{4} of building. The storm will most likely come after 3 nights. ':'<b>{0}。</b>遇到大暴雨，10次里街道大约有{1}次不被淹。它要花掉400金币里的{2}金币，需要施工{3}个晚上。暴雨最有可能在施工3个晚上之后到来。',
  'I planned for water from the alley ditch, too. ':'我把后巷水渠来的水也算进去了。',
  'I’m assuming water comes only from the street side. ':'我现在假设水只从街道那边来。',
  'With no shade, the benches will be too hot to use until sunset. ':'没有遮阴的话，太阳落山之前，长椅都烫得没法坐。',
  'Dev says 4 feet is too shallow to really skate. ':'德夫说4英尺太浅了，滑不起来。',
