  'It wasn’t done in time, and the street flooded.':'没能按时完工，街道被淹了。',
  'There was too much rain, and water reached the street.':'雨太大了，水漫到了街上。',
  'The gate waited for a phone call, and the street flooded.':'闸门一直在等电话，结果街道被淹了。',
  'The bowl stayed dry, but the street flooded.':'碗池里一滴水都没有，街道却被淹了。',
  'The street stayed dry, but the crew cut into the ditch without asking.':'街道没被淹，可施工队一声没问，就把水渠挖开了。',
